listing:   portable.hip
toolchain: Cuda compilation tools, release 12.0, V12.0.140 (with the HIP 5.7 headers, NVIDIA platform)
command:   nvcc -std=c++17 -O2 -arch=sm_80 -x cu -D__HIP_PLATFORM_NVIDIA__ portable.hip -o .tmp_nv && { ./.tmp_nv; echo "(program exit code $?)"; } && echo 'SASS of countPositive (vote, popcount, atomic):' && cuobjdump -sass .tmp_nv | grep -o -E 'VOTE[.A-Z]*|POPC|RED[.A-Z0-9]*|ATOM[.A-Z0-9]*' | sort | uniq -c | sed -E 's/^ +//'
date:      2026-10-10T00:37:04Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
hardware:  untested on hardware: the build container has no NVIDIA GPU (AH-26); the build and SASS are real, the run shows the runtime's own error
exit code: 0
